# Terror Tide: "All creatures get -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of permanent cards in your graveyard" (CR 110.4a).
# Bot1's graveyard holds no permanent cards when Terror Tide resolves (X = 0), so nothing shrinks and nothing dies: a Memnite and
# Bot2's Ornithopter keep their size. Bot2's sacrificed Black Lotus is a permanent card in Bot2's graveyard, not "your graveyard":
# counted, it would make X 1 and kill the Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Terror Tide
Memnite
Swamp x3
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Island x5
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Terror Tide.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Terror Tide
Bot2.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
